---
import SandboxLayout from '../layouts/SandboxLayout.astro';
---

<SandboxLayout
	title="Home"
	description="A stock Astro environment for qualifying CodeWorksLabs integrations on Cloudflare."
	currentPath="/"
>
	<p class="eyebrow">CodeWorksLabs test surface</p>
	<h1>Small site. Real runtime.</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		A deliberately compact Astro site for checking production builds, Cloudflare delivery,
		client navigation, and Analytics for Astro against a real browser and provider.
	</p>

	<div class="pills" aria-label="Current environment">
		<span class="pill">Astro 7.3.2</span>
		<span class="pill">Cloudflare Workers</span>
		<span class="pill">Fathom connected</span>
		<span class="pill">Search indexing disabled</span>
	</div>

	<section class="grid" aria-label="Sandbox capabilities">
		<article class="card">
			<h2>Analytics test</h2>
			<p>Use the <a href="/analytics/">interactive test page</a> to exercise the public event client and inspect its result.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="card">
			<h2>Stock foundation</h2>
			<p>The site stays intentionally small so integration behavior remains easy to observe and diagnose.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="card">
			<h2>Companion harness</h2>
			<p>Compare behavior with the <a href="https://stockstarlight.sandbox.codeworkslabs.dev/">stock Starlight sandbox</a>.</p>
		</article>
	</section>
</SandboxLayout>
